# The web app needs NO environment variables to run.
# API keys are entered in the browser and sent per request — never stored
# on the server. This file exists only for the optional CLI pipeline
# (gbn_pipeline.py), which can read a HuggingFace token from the environment.
#
# Copy to .env and fill in ONLY if you use the CLI. NEVER commit the real .env.
HF_TOKEN=hf_your_token_here
